{"version":1,"content":"<p>48歲日本一代波神雛形明子，曾紅透90年代的寫真界，就連日本國民動畫《蠟筆小新》的男主角野原新之助都自認是其粉絲。</p><p>她為紀念入行35年，上月推出睽違22年的全新寫真集《三原色》，展示熟女魅力。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;封胸多</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T14:18:28.232143+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T14:03:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T14:11:45.428984+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T14:11:45.428984+00:00","content_hash":"e6db8dabd903c9bf4bf3c2735b3ddd3eda0a9dfc82ff3ed72e132dc1c12a6161","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}